p\" class=\"btn-nav btn-substep\" title=\"Step through internal sub-expressions on this line (F7)\">🔍 Sub-Expr (F7)</button>\n27:       <button id=\"btnNext\" class=\"btn-nav btn-next-prominent\" title=\"Explain the next step (Right Arrow)\">Next Step →</button>\n28:       <button id=\"btnAutoPlay\" class=\"btn-nav\" title=\"Automatically step through the code\">▶ Auto Play</button>\n29:       <button id=\"btnRestart\" class=\"btn-nav\" title=\"Start over from Step 1\">↺ Restart</button>\n30:     </nav>\n31: \n32:     <div class=\"secondary-actions\">\n33:       <button id=\"btnEditCode\" class=\"btn-small-primary\">✏️ Paste / Edit Code</button>\n34:       <button id=\"btnToggleIterations\" class=\"btn-subtle active\" title=\"Show or hide the full Iteration & All-Steps Dry-Run panel below\">📋 All Steps / Iterations</button>\n35:       <button id=\"btnToggleAdvanced\" class=\"btn-subtle\">Advanced View</button>\n36:     </div>\n37:   </header>\n38: \n39:   <!-- Error / Validation Banner (Hidden unless there is an error) -->\n40:   <div id=\"validationBanner\" class=\"validation-banner hidden\"></div>\n41: \n42:   <!-- Dynamic Overview Banner -->\n43:   <div class=\"overview-strip\">\n44:     <span class=\"overview-label\">Goal:</span>\n45:     <span id=\"overviewText\">Paste or edit any Python program on the left to visualize every step, iteration, variable scope, and memory address.</span>\n46:   </div>\n47: \n48:   <!-- =========================================================\n49:        MAIN 3-AREA THONNY-STYLE WORKSPACE\n50:        1. Your Code (Left)\n51:        2. Step-by-Step Teaching, Iteration Bar & Sub-Expression Evaluator (Center)\n52:        3. Scope Isolation & Stack/Heap Reference Visualizer (Right)\n53:        ========================================================= -->\n54:   <main class=\"three-area-workspace\">\n55: \n56:     <!-- AREA 1: YOUR CODE (LEFT) -->\n57:     <section class=\"area-card area-code\" aria-label=\"Your Code\">\n58:       <div class=\"area-header-row\">\n59:         <h2 class=\"area-heading\">Your Code</h2>\n60:         <div class=\"code-header-actions\">\n61:           <span id=\"codeScopeIndicator\" class=\"code-scope-tag\">Scope: Global</span>\n62:           <button id=\"btnAnalyzeCode\" class=\"btn-small-primary hidden\">▶ Run Code</button>\n63:         </div>\n64:       </div>\n65: \n66:       <div id=\"codeLinesContainer\" class=\"code-view\"></div>\n67: \n68:       <!-- Code Editor Textarea when user clicks \"Paste / Edit Code\" -->\n69:       <div id=\"liveEditorWrap\" class=\"live-editor-wrap hidden\">\n70:         <textarea id=\"codeTextarea\" class=\"code-textarea\" placeholder=\"Paste any Python code here and click ▶ Run Code...\" spellcheck=\"false\"></textarea>\n71:       </div>\n72:     </section>\n73: \n74:     <!-- AREA 2: TEACHING AREA, ITERATION JUMP BAR & THONNY EXPRESSION STEPPER (CENTER) -->\n75:     <section class=\"area-card area-teaching\" aria-label=\"Step-by-Step Explanation\">\n76:       <div class=\"teaching-card-inner\">\n77: \n78:         <!-- Quick Iteration / Call Phase Jump Bar -->\n79:         <div class=\"iteration-jump-strip\">\n80:           <div class=\"iteration-jump-header\">\n81:             <span class=\"iteration-jump-label\">🔄 Iterations & Execution Phases (Click to Jump):</span>\n82:             <span id=\"activeIterationBadge\" class=\"iteration-active-badge\">Phase 1</span>\n83:           </div>\n84:           <div id=\"iterationPillsBar\" class=\"iteration-pills-bar\"></div>\n85:         </div>\n86: \n87:         <!-- Step Heading -->\n88:         <div class=\"teach-header-row\">\n89:           <h1 id=\"teachStepTitle\" class=\"teach-step-title\">Step 1: Create the variable</h1>\n90:           <span id=\"teachScopeBadge\" class=\"scope-pill scope-global\">GLOBAL SCOPE</span>\n91:         </div>\n92: \n93:         <!-- Current Code Line Box -->\n94:         <div class=\"teach-section\">\n95:           <div class=\"teach-label\">Code:</div>\n96:           <div id=\"teachCodeBox\" class=\"teach-code-box\">c = 0</div>\n97:         </div>\n98: \n99:         <!-- TASK 2.1, 2.2, 2.3: THONNY-STYLE STEP-BY-STEP SUB-EXPRESSION EVALUATOR -->\n100:         <div id=\"thonnyExprBox\" class=\"thonny-expr-card\">\n101:           <div class=\"thonny-expr-header\">\n102:             <span class=\"thonny-badge\">Thonny Expression Evaluator</span>\n103:             <span id=\"thonnySubStepCounter\" class=\"thonny-subcounter\">Evaluation 1 of 1</span>\n104:           </div>\n105:           <div id=\"thonnyLiveCode\" class=\"thonny-live-code\"></div>\n106:           <div id=\"thonnyFocusNote\" class=\"thonny-focus-note\"></div>\n107:           <div id=\"thonnyTrailChips\" class=\"thonny-trail-chips\"></div>\n108:         </div>\n109: \n110:         <!-- Step Calculation Breakdown (Shown on arithmetic / condition / loop steps) -->\n111:         <div id=\"teachCalculationBox\" class=\"teach-calc-box hidden\">\n112:           <div id=\"calcCurrentNumRow\" class=\"calc-row hidden\">\n113:             <span class=\"calc-label\">Current number:</span>\n114:             <code id=\"calcCurrentNumVal\" class=\"calc-val\"></code>\n115:           </div>\n116:           <div class=\"calc-row\">\n117:             <span class=\"calc-label\">Before:</span>\n118:             <code id=\"calcBeforeVal\" class=\"calc-val\"></code>\n119:           </div>\n120:           <div class=\"calc-row\">\n121:             <span class=\"calc-label\">Calculation:</span>\n122:             <code id=\"calcFormulaVal\" class=\"calc-val calc-highlight\"></code>\n123:           </div>\n124:           <div class=\"calc-row\">\n125:             <span class=\"calc-label\">After:</span>\n126:             <code id=\"calcAfterVal\" class=\"calc-val calc-after\"></code>\n127:           </div>\n128:         </div>\n129: \n130:         <!-- What does this mean? -->\n131:         <div class=\"teach-section\">\n132:           <div class=\"teach-label\">What does this mean?</div>\n133:           <p id=\"teachMeaningText\" class=\"teach-meaning-text\"></p>\n134:         </div>\n135: \n136:         <!-- Variable values now -->\n137:         <div class=\"teach-section\">\n138:           <div class=\"teach-label\">Variable values now:</div>\n139:           <div id=\"teachVarsNowBox\" class=\"teach-vars-now\"></div>\n140:         </div>\n141: \n142:         <!-- What happens next? -->\n143:         <div class=\"teach-section teach-next-box\">\n144:           <div class=\"teach-label\">What happens next?</div>\n145:           <p id=\"teachNextText\" class=\"teach-next-text\"></p>\n146:         </div>\n147: \n148:         <!-- Final Answer Celebration Banner (Shown on final return or final print step) -->\n149:         <div id=\"finalAnswerBanner\" class=\"final-answer-banner hidden\">\n150:           <div id=\"finalAnswerHeading\" class=\"final-answer-heading\">Final answer: 6</div>\n151:           <div id=\"finalAnswerDetail\" class=\"final-answer-detail\"></div>\n152:         </div>\n153: \n154:       </div>\n155:     </section>\n156: \n157:     <!-- AREA 3: SCOPE ISOLATION & STACK/HEAP MEMORY VISUALIZER (RIGHT) -->\n158:     <section class=\"area-card area-variables\" aria-label=\"Scopes and Memory Reference Model\">\n159:       <div class=\"area-header-row\">\n160:         <h2 class=\"area-heading\">Scopes & Memory Model</h2>\n161:         <span class=\"ref-legend-pill\" title=\"Python variables store memory addresses pointing to Heap objects\">Name → @Addr → Value</span>\n162:       </div>\n163: \n164:       <!-- TASK 4.1 & 4.2: ISOLATED STACK SCOPES (GLOBAL vs. LOCAL) -->\n165:       <div class=\"memory-section-block\">\n166:         <div class=\"memory-section-title\">1. Stack Frames (Global vs. Local Scope Isolation)</div>\n167:         <div id=\"scopeFramesContainer\" class=\"scope-frames-container\"></div>\n168:       </div>\n169: \n170:       <!-- TASK 3.1, 3.2 & 3.3: HEAP MEMORY OBJECTS + VISUAL GARBAGE COLLECTION -->\n171:       <div class=\"memory-section-block\">\n172:         <div class=\"heap-header-row\">\n173:           <span class=\"memory-section-title\">2. Heap Memory (@Address → Object Value)</span>\n174:           <button id=\"btnToggleGC\" class=\"btn-gc-toggle\" title=\"Toggle unreferenced / garbage-collected objects from earlier loop steps\">\n175:             Show GC'd (0)\n176:           </button>\n177:         </div>\n178:         <div id=\"heapObjectsContainer\" class=\"heap-objects-container\"></div>\n179:       </div>\n180: \n181:       <!-- Clean Visual List Box for `nums` / `arr` / `s.items` -->\n182:       <div id=\"visualListsContainer\" class=\"visual-list-wrap\"></div>\n183: \n184:       <!-- Live Console Output (`print`) when program prints values -->\n185:       <div id=\"stdoutSection\" class=\"memory-section-block hidden\">\n186:         <div class=\"memory-section-title\">3. Console Output (print)</div>\n187:         <pre id=\"stdoutBox\" class=\"stdout-box\"></pre>\n188:       </div>\n189:     </section>\n190: \n191:   </main>\n192: \n193:   <!-- =========================================================\n194:        AREA 4: COMPLETE CODE ITERATION & ALL-STEPS DRY-RUN EXPLORER\n195:        Visible by default so the whole code execution is clear at a glance\n196:        ========================================================= -->\n197:   <section id=\"allIterationsSection\" class=\"iterations-explorer-section\" aria-label=\"All Iterations and Steps Dry-Run\">\n198:     <div class=\"iterations-explorer-header\">\n199:       <div class=\"iterations-title-group\">\n200:         <h2 class=\"iterations-main-title\">📋 Complete Code Iteration & Step-by-Step Dry-Run</h2>\n201:         <span id=\"iterationsSummaryBadge\" class=\"iterations-summary-badge\">All Steps Visible</span>\n202:       </div>\n203: \n204:       <div class=\"iterations-controls-group\">\n205:         <div class=\"view-mode-tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n206:           <button id=\"tabViewGrouped\" type=\"button\" class=\"view-tab-btn active\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\">\n207:             🔄 Grouped by Iterations / Calls\n208:           </button>\n209:           <button id=\"tabViewTable\" type=\"button\" class=\"view-tab-btn\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">\n210:             📊 All Steps Table (1 → N)\n211:           </button>\n212:         </div>\n213:         <button id=\"btnExpandAllIter\" type=\"button\" class=\"btn-subtle\">Expand / Collapse All</button>\n214:       </div>\n215:     </div>\n216: \n217:     <p class=\"iterations-helper-note\">\n218:       Every iteration, function call, and line execution from start to finish is listed below. <strong>Click any step or iteration card</strong> to jump the visualizer to that exact moment.\n219:     </p>\n220: \n221:     <!-- View 1: Grouped by Loop Iterations / Method Calls -->\n222:     <div id=\"iterationsGroupedContainer\" class=\"iterations-grouped-container\"></div>\n223: \n224:     <!-- View 2: Full Dry-Run Table (Every Step 1 -> N) -->\n225:     <div id=\"iterationsTableContainer\" class=\"iterations-table-container hidden\">\n226:       <div class=\"dryrun-table-scroll\">\n227:         <table class=\"dryrun-table\" aria-label=\"Complete Execution Dry-Run Table\">\n228:           <thead>\n229:             <tr>\n230:               <th>Step</th>\n231:               <th>Line</th>\n232:               <th>Iteration / Phase</th>\n233:               <th>Scope</th>\n234:               <th>Code Executed</th>\n235:               <th>What Happened / Calculation</th>\n236:               <th>Variables Snapshot</th>\n237:             </tr>\n238:           </thead>\n239:           <tbody id=\"dryrunTableBody\"></tbody>\n240:         </table>\n241:       </div>\n242:     </div>\n243:   </section>\n244: \n245:   <!-- =========================================================\n246:        OPTIONAL ADVANCED VIEW DRAWER (Hidden by Default)\n247:        =======================================================